    "note": "Substitute Senate Bill (Comm Sub, Ways & Means), HTML with marks. Strikes the role of local law enforcement agencies (WSP alone runs the program, no reimbursement of local agencies) and replaces 'an individual' with 'a Washington resident'. Sec. 3 is an emergency clause. Subsection (1)(d) quote is the added sentence only."
